1. Each shift must have a start time less than an end time.
2. Both start and end times must be between 0 and 1440 minutes.
3. Each shift must last at least 30 minutes and at most 240 minutes.
4. Shifts cannot overlap.
5. Between the end of one shift and the start of the next (when times are in order), there must be at least 15 minutes.
6. The total time of all shifts must be at most 600 minutes.
7. An empty schedule is okay.

